> Anatomy of a Well Designed Home Page: Part 1 - Splat, Inc.
[Your website]�[�]s home page is the[ most] important page on[ your] business�[�] site. Much like a headline in a[ print] advertisement, its success will largely determine whether[ visitors] surf to deeper[ content] or take a[ quick] glance and call it a day. Nail the essentials of good home page design[ and] you�[�]ve radically increased[ your brand]�[�s conversion] goals,[ from mailing list] signups,[ to purchasing] products or buying a[ S]aaS[ subscription product].
