=== Text #1 ===
> Smooth Philadelphia R&B[ group] that featured soaring harmonies and[ Russell Th]ompkins' distinctive falsetto.
On March 21, 1951 was born soul singer, Russell[ Th]ompkins Jr, former lead singer of the Philadelphia soul vocal group, the St[yl]istics; a[ group] that churned out master[pieces] such as the 1975 US No.1 single 'You Make Me Feel Brand New', and many more.
